B.a54=new A.a2("Radios","EACH RADIO IS POLLED INDEPENDENTLY ON ITS OWN TIMER. NODE IDS ARE NAMESPACED PER DRIVER, SO MESHES NEVER COLLIDE. IN SIMULATED MODE THIS LIST IS IGNORED.")
B.a5G=new A.a2("Detector \u2014 poll interval","POLL INTERVAL IN SECONDS \u2014 THE SIM + DEFAULT FOR NEW RADIOS.")
B.a50=new A.a2("Detector \u2014 confirm polls","CONFIRM POLLS \u2014 LOWER IS FASTER, HIGHER IS CALMER (1\u20135).")
B.a5c=new A.a2("Wi-Fi sensing \u2014 dip threshold","DIP THRESHOLD (DB, 3\u201312 \u2014 LOWER IS MORE SENSITIVE, HIGHER IS CALMER).")
B.a4V=new A.a2("Mesh calibration",'GUIDED "DIAL IT IN" ROUTINE \u2014 EMPLACE NODES, KEEP THE AREA CLEAR 30\u201360 S, THEN NUDGE THE NAMED WORST NODE UNTIL FADE LEVELS STOP IMPROVING. SETS THE DRIFT-COMPENSATED REFERENCE ANCHORS; DETECTION ITSELF STAYS DETERMINISTIC. ONE ROUND \u2248 10 S AFTER MOVING THE NAMED NODE. STOP WHEN NO LINK IMPROVES > 1 DB ACROSS TWO ROUNDS, OR TAP DONE.')
B.a4S=new A.a2("SDR station","PASSIVE-DOPPLER GEOMETRY. CONVERTED TO FIELD-LOCAL METERS AT APPLY TIME (GPS FIELD ORIGIN WHEN SET, ELSE RELATIVE TO THE STATION). PERSISTED WITH THE OTHER SETTINGS. AUTO STATION: TAKE THE STATION POSITION FROM THIS DEVICE'S GPS FIX \u2014 THE SDR HOST IN THE FIELD SETUP. RE-ARMS WHEN THE DEVICE MOVES >25 M; A FIX OLDER THAN 30 MIN DOES NOT ARM. THE eNB POSITION HAS NO AUTO SOURCE AND STAYS MANUAL. MANUAL STATION VALUES BELOW ARE KEPT, JUST NOT USED WHILE AUTO IS ON.")
B.a5l=new A.a2("Simulated mode","GENERATE SYNTHETIC LINK DATA \u2014 NO HARDWARE NEEDED. CLEARLY LABELED ON THE DASHBOARD.")
B.a51=new A.a2("Wi-Fi vision","USE THIS DEVICE'S WI-FI ADAPTER AS AN AMBIENT DISTURBANCE SENSOR. COARSE RSSI SENSING \u2014 DETECTS DISTURBANCES, CANNOT IMAGE OBJECTS.")
B.a4U=new A.a2("Camera confirmation","MOTION WEBHOOK (POST /motion) OR ONVIF EVENTS. CAMERA EVIDENCE MAY UPGRADE DISPLAYED CONFIDENCE BUT NEVER VETOES OR SUPPRESSES A DETECTION.")
B.a4X=new A.a2("Experimental sensors","SHOW SENSORS STILL IN TESTING IN THE SENSORS LIST. THEY ARE LABELLED EXPERIMENTAL WHEREVER THEY APPEAR.")
B.a5_=new A.a2("Fetch voice alerts","SPEAK FETCH TRIP ALERTS THROUGH THE EUD AUDIO OUTPUT INTO HEARING PROTECTION. DEFAULT OFF. Spoken Fetch trip alerts through the EUD audio output into hearing protection. Direction comes from GPS positions only \u2014 indoors GPS usually dies and alerts speak without direction rather than guessing. Reaches the operator carrying this EUD; whole-team distribution needs a radio bridge and is out of scope. The Fetch senses movement and presence \u2014 it never identifies anyone as an enemy, a friendly, or a civilian, and never states armed status. The operator decides what a detection is.")
B.a5L=new A.a2("Phone-only tier","WHEN ON, THE DASHBOARD SHOWS THE PHONE-ONLY BANNER \u2014 BUT ONLY WHEN NO MESH/SDR HARDWARE IS ATTACHED. MESH USERS SEE ZERO CHANGE FROM THIS DEFAULT-ON SWITCH. LABELS ARE ALWAYS PHONE-ONLY / PHONE-RANGE (TENS OF METERS, NOT AREA COVERAGE). (THIS SWITCH CONTROLS ONLY THE BANNER; HUNT IS REACHED FROM ITS OWN BUTTON AND IS NOT GATED BY THIS SWITCH.)")
B.a5d=new A.a2("Device signature library","MATCH PHONE-VISIBLE WI-FI / BLE OBSERVATIONS AGAINST A SIGNATURE CATALOG. EVERY MATCH IS A HYPOTHESIS \u2014 NOT IDENTITY. USER-ADDED ENTRIES COME FROM device_signatures.json IN THE APP DOCUMENTS DIRECTORY AND ARE LABELED USER-ADDED. DEFAULT OFF. MISSING device_signatures.json MEANS BUILT-IN ONLY \u2014 THAT IS NORMAL, NOT AN ERROR.")
B.a5x=new A.a2("Offline map packs","DOWNLOAD A MAP BEFORE YOU LEAVE WI-FI \u2014 STATE PACKS (ONE TAP PER STATE, ZOOM 0\u201312) AND AREA PACKS (AROUND THE SEARCH AREA, UP TO ZOOM 16/17). THE FIELD MAP RENDERS FROM THE PACK WITH NO CONNECTIVITY. TILES: USGS NATIONAL MAP (U.S. PUBLIC DOMAIN).")
B.a5f=new A.a2("Record & replay","CAPTURE RAW SAMPLES TO CSV FOR LATER REPLAY. REPLAY RUNS THE RECORDING THROUGH THE LIVE DETECTOR \u2014 TUNE THRESHOLDS, THEN REPLAY TO SEE WHAT THE NEW SETTINGS WOULD HAVE CAUGHT.")
B.a59=new A.a2("Emit CoT tracks","PUBLISH THE FUSED TRACK AS CURSOR-ON-TARGET EVENTS. EMIT-ONLY, DEFENSIVE-ONLY \u2014 THE ONLY BYTES SENT ARE THIS MESH'S OWN TRACK EVENTS, AND AFFILIATION IS ALWAYS UNKNOWN. DEFAULT OFF.")
B.a5p=new A.a2("Listen for emitter tracks","INGEST COT TRACKS WHOSE CALLSIGN MATCHES THE EMITTER PREFIX (RX-ONLY). SPATIAL COINCIDENCES WITH THE OUTRIDE TRACK UPGRADE CONFIDENCE ONLY \u2014 NEVER SUBTRACT, NEVER ORIGINATE A TRACK. DEFAULT OFF.")
B.a5A=new A.a2("Drones \u2014 friendly fleet","YOUR OWN AIRFRAMES, BY BATTERY-TRAY SERIAL. CONTROLLER COT (FRIENDLY AIR EVENTS ON THE LISTENER ABOVE) MAKES THEM CLASS B POSITION NODES; A SERIAL HERE LETS OUTRIDE NAME THEM AND CORROBORATE OTHER FEEDS. A MATCH CHANGES RENDERING ONLY \u2014 IT NEVER SUPPRESSES A TRACK OR AN ALERT.")
B.a5b=new A.a2("Remote ID","DECODE FAA REMOTE ID BROADCASTS (ASTM F3411) FROM BLE ADVERTISEMENTS AND WI-FI BEACONS \u2014 RECEIVE-ONLY. CIVIL DRONES ONLY: MILITARY D-MODEL AIRFRAMES (X10D) MAY BROADCAST NOTHING, SO NO CONTACT NEVER MEANS NO DRONE. DEFAULT OFF. WI-FI NAN REMOTE ID UNAVAILABLE ON STOCK ANDROID \u2014 BLE / WI-FI BEACON ONLY. BLE 5 EXTENDED ADVERTISING IS PLATFORM-DEPENDENT.")
B.a5N=new A.a2("Drone tab streams","DRONE TAB STREAMS \u2014 VIEWER-SIDE SELECTION ONLY. EO AND THERMAL ARE SEPARATE SIMULTANEOUS STREAMS FROM THE AIRCRAFT; THE TAB SWITCHES WHICH ONE YOU WATCH. THE EO STREAM IS THE PILOT\u2019S FOCAL VIEW (WIDE/TELE IS THE PILOT\u2019S CHOICE). OUTRIDE SENDS NOTHING TO THE AIRCRAFT.")
B.a5e=new A.a2("ZMeta export",'HAVE AN INVITE CODE FROM A HUB OPERATOR? JOINING REGISTERS THIS MESH \u2014 OVER ENCRYPTED HTTPS WHEN THE HUB SUPPORTS IT (NO OTHER APP NEEDED), OR VIA WIREGUARD. EXPORT STAYS OFF UNTIL YOU ENABLE IT BELOW. SEND EACH DETECTION TO THE HUB AS OBSERVATION / INFERENCE EVENTS (EMIT-ONLY). ONE MESH = ONE PLATFORM ID \u2014 THE GATEWAY FUSES ACROSS MESHES. LINK SECURED: CONFIRM THE WIREGUARD TUNNEL TO THE GATEWAY IS ACTIVE. THE APP CANNOT VERIFY THIS ITSELF. MESH HEARTBEAT: PERIODIC "ALIVE, HERE IS THE PLATFORM" TO THE GATEWAY (SYSTEM_EVENT). FOR TEAMS ON THE MOVE. DEFAULT OFF.')
B.a4Z=new A.a2("Fleet","EUDS ON THE SAME WI-FI FORM ONE FLEET WITH A 4-DIGIT PIN. NO MANUAL IP ENTRY, NO MANUAL PAIRING. A FLEET WITH A LIVE SILVUS RADIO SENSES; WITHOUT ONE IT IS A FUSION PEER.")
B.a5n=new A.a2("Auto-connect Silvus USB","WHEN A SILVUS RADIO APPEARS ON USB (172.17.97.X), VALIDATE IT AND ADD IT AUTOMATICALLY. UNPLUGGING NEVER REMOVES THE CONFIG \u2014 IT RECONNECTS ON REPLUG.")
